# Raw Spectre run output stays local (author's decision, 2026-11-13): the logs name the user,
# the server and the licence server, and record Spectre's own timings and memory, which may
# not be publishable under the Cadence licence agreement (being checked). The result files
# (PSF), their logFile indexes and the netlists are the golden data and are committed.
spectre.log
summary*.txt
environment*.txt
ahdlcmi*.out
# verilog-a-sim against Spectre, time and memory: local until the agreement is checked
*.local.md
